---
title: M12 Implemented authenticated node-info boundary
---
flowchart TB
    subgraph APP["EXPLICIT HOST COMPOSITION"]
        C["Typed config + DER trust and credentials<br/>Configured node / incarnation and peer allowlist"]
        R["Public register_client / register_server<br/>Stage factories, validate and freeze"]
        F["Create endpoints; choose providers<br/>One private runtime per owner<br/>Server binds loopback only"]
        C --> R --> F
    end
    subgraph CALL["ONE READ-ONLY REQUEST"]
        T["ReadNodeTask with injected RemoteNodeClient<br/>Prepare node.info header + typed Info payload"]
        H["Optional HTTPS adapter<br/>Private JSON codec; bounded HTTP/1 call<br/>No retry; unchanged expiry and IDs"]
        TLS["Mutual TLS verification<br/>Expected server trust / name<br/>Verified client leaf maps to subject"]
        D["Bounded typed decode and target check<br/>Unknown body variants rejected<br/>Caller claims never become identity"]
        B["Existing shared Bridge<br/>Header route + version lookup<br/>Separate operation authorization<br/>Deadline recheck + payload agreement"]
        N["Injected local NodeInfoSource<br/>Configured identity + compile-target facts<br/>Not health or hardware probes"]
        O["Typed reply checks<br/>Responder / incarnation and original IDs<br/>Bounded fields; reject late result"]
        T --> H --> TLS --> D --> B --> N --> O
    end
    F -.-> T
    F -.-> TLS
    L["LIMITS AND SCOPE<br/>Sequential connection; synchronous trusted callbacks are not preempted<br/>Timeout / lost reply may follow observation<br/>No remote files, IDE, jobs, deployment or Bitwave"]
    O --- L
